# el15 (2026-10-25): HTILE mask notes for dispatch items (APS5_ITEM_HTILE_MASKS), alone and with deferred stores, 3 rounds.
measure 60
base-1 75
htm-1 75 switch APS5_ITEM_HTILE_MASKS on
dhtm-1 75 deferstores on;;switch APS5_ITEM_HTILE_MASKS on
defer-1 75 deferstores on
base-2 75
htm-2 75 switch APS5_ITEM_HTILE_MASKS on
dhtm-2 75 deferstores on;;switch APS5_ITEM_HTILE_MASKS on
defer-2 75 deferstores on
base-3 75
htm-3 75 switch APS5_ITEM_HTILE_MASKS on
dhtm-3 75 deferstores on;;switch APS5_ITEM_HTILE_MASKS on
defer-3 75 deferstores on
base-z 75
